      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont even know why im writing this. i feel like there's just nothing left inside. i used to have so much to say, so much to create, but now it’s like i'm just an empty vessel. a fraud. i look at my old work and it feels like it was written by a ghost. there's just this massive, hollow void where my soul used to be and i dont think it's coming back.",
