      "role": "user",
      "content": "the \"gentle with yourself\" thing feels so patronizing. it's not just a bad mood or a block. it's the realization that the version of me that mattered is actually gone. there's nothing left to save. i'm just standing here in the wreckage of who i was, and it's so exhausting to pretend there's still something worth building.",
